    Add thumbnail support to YouTube publication service (#7320)
    
    This PR adds support for uploading a custom thumbnail when publishing to
    YouTube.
    
    Two new configuration options have been added to the `publish-youtube`
    workflow operation:
    - `thumbnail-flavor`: Specifies the flavor of the attachment to use as a
    thumbnail.
    - `thumbnail-tags`: Specifies the tags of the attachment to use as a
    thumbnail.
    
    **Note:** To test thumbnail uploads, the YouTube account must be
    verified with a phone number.
    
    For details on thumbnail restrictions (size, format, etc.), please refer
    to the updated documentation or the [YouTube Data API
    documentation](https://developers.google.com/youtube/v3/docs/thumbnails/set).
